(13: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%20Instructions%20for%20automated%20contributors%0A%0AThese%20rules%20apply%20to%20every%20automated%20agent%20%28AI%20solver%2C%20bot%20or%20script%29%20that%0Achanges%20this%20repository.%20Human%20contributors%20follow%20them%20too%3B%20see%0A%5BCONTRIBUTING.md%5D%28CONTRIBUTING.md%29%20for%20the%20development%20setup.%0A%0A%23%23%20The%20contract%0A%0A-%20%5B%60docs%2Fvision.md%60%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%29%20is%20the%20authoritative%20vision%20and%0A%20%20architecture%20specification.%20Read%20it%20before%20starting.%20Do%20not%20add%20a%20competing%0A%20%20vision%2C%20roadmap%20or%20architecture%20description%20elsewhere.%20If%20the%20work%20changes%20the%0A%20%20architecture%2C%20update%20%60docs%2Fvision.md%60%20in%20the%20same%20pull%20request.%0A-%20Requirements%20come%20only%20from%20the%20sources%20registered%20in%0A%20%20%5B%60parity%2Fissue-195-sources.lino%60%5D%28parity%2Fissue-195-sources.lino%29%2C%20with%20their%0A%20%20content%20hashes.%20Before%20relying%20on%20the%20ledger%2C%20run%0A%20%20%60cd%20js%20%26%26%20npm%20run%20check%3Aissue-195%3Asources%20--%20--online%60.%20When%20it%20reports%20an%0A%20%20edited%20or%20unregistered%20comment%2C%20re-read%20the%20comment%2C%20reconcile%20the%20ledger%20rows%0A%20%20and%20then%20refresh%20the%20register%20with%20%60--update%60.%0A-%20Every%20obligation%20is%20an%20atomic%20row%20of%0A%20%20%5B%60parity%2Fissue-195-requirements.lino%60%5D%28parity%2Fissue-195-requirements.lino%29%2C%0A%20%20generated%20by%20%60js%2Fscripts%2Fissue-195-requirements.mjs%60.%20Add%20rows%20for%20new%0A%20%20obligations.%20Never%20remove%20a%20row%2C%20an%20assertion%2C%20a%20fixture%2C%20a%20runtime%20or%20an%0A%20%20alias%2C%20and%20never%20rewrite%20a%20row%27s%20source%2C%20expected%20behavior%20or%20scope.%0A%0A%23%23%20Evidence%2C%20not%20declarations%0A%0A-%20A%20requirement%20passes%20only%20when%20tests%20executed%20on%20the%20exact%20commit%20recorded%0A%20%20every%20declared%20assertion%20for%20every%20declared%20fixture.%20Record%20observations%0A%20%20%28%60recordIssue195Observations%60%20in%20JavaScript%2C%20%60record%60%20in%20Rust%29%20only%20after%20the%0A%20%20assertions%20hold.%0A-%20Do%20not%20add%20status%2C%20complete%20or%20completed%20fields%2C%20skipped%20cells%2C%20planned%0A%20%20fixtures%20presented%20as%20evidence%2C%20or%20capability%20declarations%20presented%20as%0A%20%20support.%0A-%20Every%20PR%20check%20must%20pass.%20A%20red%20check%20is%20a%20defect%20to%20fix%20now%3B%20unfinished%0A%20%20requirements%20are%20work%20to%20implement%2C%20not%20a%20reason%20for%20red%20CI.%20Never%20weaken%20a%0A%20%20gate%2C%20an%20oracle%20mapping%20or%20an%20acceptance%20definition%20to%20turn%20it%20green.%0A-%20A%20pull%20request%20check%20depends%20only%20on%20what%20exists%20before%20merge.%20Live%20rules%2C%0A%20%20live%20registries%2C%20live%20comment%20edits%20and%20published%20packages%20are%20checked%20on%0A%20%20%60main%60%20as%20non-blocking%20post-merge%20reports%3B%20a%20failure%20there%20is%20fixed%20in%20a%0A%20%20follow-up.%0A-%20Do%20not%20claim%20completion%20in%20documentation%2C%20changelogs%2C%20pull%20request%0A%20%20descriptions%20or%20releases%20while%20any%20ledger%20row%20fails.%20Do%20not%20add%20an%0A%20%20issue-closing%20directive%20until%20every%20requirement%20is%20verified%20and%20delivered.%0A%0A%23%23%20Development%20order%0A%0ASee%20%5BJavaScript%20first%20and%20self-translation%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%23javascript-first-and-self-translation%29%0Aand%20%5Bcontinuous%20integration%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%23continuous-integration%29.%0A%0A-%20JavaScript%20first%3A%20draft%20and%20debug%20a%20whole%20batch%20of%20changes%20in%20JavaScript%2C%0A%20%20then%20port%20it%20to%20Rust%20in%20one%20batch%2C%20by%20self-translation%20wherever%20the%20tool%20can%0A%20%20do%20it%2C%20and%20check%20that%20Rust%20behaves%20the%20same.%20Do%20not%20mirror%20fixes%20into%20Rust%0A%20%20commit%20by%20commit.%0A-%20Self-translation%20and%20lossless%20round%20trips%20%28%5Bdocs%2Fself-translation.md%5D%28docs%2Fself-translation.md%29%29%3A%20code%20the%20translator%20cannot%20port%0A%20%20yet%20is%20a%20gap%20in%20the%20translator%2C%20not%20something%20to%20write%20by%20hand.%0A-%20Grammars%20come%20from%20the%20automated%20pipeline%2C%20in%20bulk%20over%20every%20catalog%0A%20%20language%3B%20adjustments%20are%20recorded%20data-driven%20rules%2C%20never%20hand%20edits%20of%0A%20%20generated%20grammars.%20Tree-sitter%20is%20only%20a%20test%20oracle.%0A-%20Extend%20behavior%20through%20decorators%2C%20stored%20as%20links%20data%20both%20packages%0A%20%20share%2C%20rather%20than%20special%20cases%20in%20host%20code.%0A-%20Bulk%20changes%20and%20no%20idle%20waiting%3A%20push%20once%20per%20batch%20and%20keep%20working%20while%0A%20%20CI%20runs.%0A-%20CI%20runs%20the%20Rust%20workflow%20only%20after%20the%20JavaScript%20workflow%20passed%2C%20and%0A%20%20every%20job%20reports%20all%20of%20its%20failures%20%28%60cargo%20test%20--no-fail-fast%60%2C%20check%0A%20%20steps%20that%20run%20unless%20the%20run%20was%20cancelled%29.%0A-%20Resource%20limits%3A%20see%20%5Blocal%20checks%20and%20resources%5D%28%23local-checks-and-resources%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Code%0A%0A-%20Both%20runtime%20packages%20%28%60js%2F%60%20and%20%60rust%2F%60%29%20implement%20every%20feature%20with%20the%0A%20%20same%20observable%20behavior%3B%20update%0A%20%20%5B%60parity%2Flanguage-features.lino%60%5D%28parity%2Flanguage-features.lino%29%20with%20the%0A%20%20change.%0A-%20Canonical%20concept%20names%20are%20unabbreviated%20English%20noun%20phrases%2C%20and%20operations%0A%20%20are%20verb%20phrases%20%28see%0A%20%20%5Breadable%20English%20names%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%23readable-english-names%29%29.%20A%20new%0A%20%20canonical%20name%20needs%20a%20record%20in%0A%20%20%5B%60parity%2Fnaming%2Fcanonical-concepts.lino%60%5D%28parity%2Fnaming%2Fcanonical-concepts.lino%29%3B%0A%20%20%60cd%20js%20%26%26%20npm%20run%20check%3Anaming%60%20checks%20every%20record%20and%20source%20name%20against%0A%20%20WordNet%203.1%2C%20the%20registered%20abbreviations%20and%20technical%20terms%2C%20and%20the%0A%20%20positive%20and%20negative%20fixtures%20in%0A%20%20%5B%60parity%2Fnaming%2Fnaming-fixtures.lino%60%5D%28parity%2Fnaming%2Fnaming-fixtures.lino%29.%0A-%20Keep%20experiments%20in%20%60experiments%2F%60%20and%20runnable%20demonstrations%20in%20%60examples%2F%60.%0A-%20Add%20a%20changelog%20fragment%20under%20%60rust%2Fchangelog.d%2F%60%20for%20user-visible%20changes.%0A%0A%23%23%20Local%20checks%20and%20resources%0A%0ALocal%20sandboxes%20have%20a%20few%20gigabytes%20of%20memory%2C%20and%20the%20full%20suites%20do%20not%20fit%0Ain%20them.%20Run%20only%20the%20checks%20that%20cover%20the%20change%2C%20and%20let%20CI%20run%20the%20full%0Asuites%3A%0A%0A-%20JavaScript%3A%20%60cd%20js%20%26%26%20node%20--test%20tests%2F%3Carea%3E%2A.test.js%60%2C%20plus%20the%0A%20%20%60npm%20run%20check%3A%3Cname%3E%60%20scripts%20that%20cover%20the%20change.%0A-%20Rust%3A%20check%20the%20changed%20files%20with%20%60rustfmt%20--edition%202024%20--check%60%3B%20use%0A%20%20%60--config%20skip_children%3Dtrue%60%20for%20module%20roots.%20Never%20compile%20Rust%20locally.%0A%20%20Run%20the%20corresponding%20bounded%20JavaScript%20checks%20and%20let%20CI%20run%20native%0A%20%20compilation%2C%20tests%20and%20runtime%20parity.%0A-%20Wrap%20long%20runs%20in%20%60node%20scripts%2Fwith-cache-cleanup.mjs%20--event%20test%20--%20%3Ccommand%3E%60%2C%0A%20%20which%20bounds%20their%20parallelism%20and%20cleans%20up%20even%20when%20they%20fail.%0A-%20Never%20run%20locally%3A%20the%20full%20%60npm%20run%20acceptance%3Aissue-195%60%2C%0A%20%20%60js%2Fscripts%2Frun-issue-195-evidence.mjs%60%2C%20the%20native%20Lean%2C%20Rocq%20and%20Rust%0A%20%20translation%20matrix%2C%20clean-consumer%20installs%2C%20the%20Relative%20Meta%20Logic%20and%0A%20%20formal-ai%20workload%20clones%2C%20%60cargo%20llvm-cov%60%2C%20or%20experiments%20over%20upstream%0A%20%20corpora%20or%20the%20whole%20grammar%20registry.%20The%20%60CI%60%20workflow%0A%20%20%28%60.github%2Fworkflows%2Fci.yml%60%29%2C%20which%20runs%20the%20JavaScript%20jobs%2C%20then%20the%20Rust%0A%20%20jobs%20and%20the%20issue%20195%20acceptance%20stages%2C%20runs%20them%20on%20every%20push%3B%20read%20its%0A%20%20logs%20and%20artifacts%20instead.%0A-%20Work%20in%20batches%3A%20commit%20each%20step%2C%20re-read%20the%20diff%20and%20push%20once%20per%20batch.%0A%20%20Use%20the%20shared%20checkout%20and%20release%20completed%20task-owned%20worktrees%20under%0A%20%20%5Bthe%20resource%20policy%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%23resource-limits%29.%0A%20%20After%20a%20batch%2C%20run%20%60node%20scripts%2Fclean-caches.mjs%60%3B%20remove%20only%0A%20%20meta-language-owned%20regenerable%20scratch%20and%20stopped%20workload%20clones.%0A%20%20Preserve%20verification%20records%20and%20logs%2C%0A%20%20%60issue-195-artifacts%2F%60%2C%20and%20%60issue-195-results%2F%60%20outside%20disposable%20%60work%2F%60%0A%20%20scratch.%20Never%20remove%20dirty%20worktrees%2C%20uncommitted%20work%2C%20active%20tasks%20or%0A%20%20unrelated%20directories.%20Stop%20only%20leftover%20processes%20owned%20by%20the%20failed%20task.%0A%20%20Never%20compile%20Rust%20locally.%0A-%20Before%20local%20cleanup%20or%20a%20wrapped%20check%2C%20unset%20inherited%20%60CARGO_TARGET_DIR%60%0A%20%20and%20%60CARGO_BUILD_TARGET_DIR%60%20unless%20their%20resolved%20paths%20are%20verified%20as%0A%20%20storage%20owned%20by%20this%20meta-language%20task.%20A%20Cargo%20cache%20marker%20alone%20does%0A%20%20not%20establish%20project%20ownership.%20Use%20%60--no-preflight%20--no-docker%60%20for%20manual%0A%20%20local%20cleanup%20and%20retain%20its%20receipt%3B%20see%20the%20same%20resource%20policy%20above.%0A%20%20Also%20pass%20%60--project-owned-only%60%20to%20task-scoped%20cleanup%20and%20wrapped%20checks.%0A%20%20It%20excludes%20external%20Cargo%20targets%20before%20discovery%2C%20disables%20container%0A%20%20cleanup%20and%20low-disk%20escalation%2C%20and%20records%20the%20selected%20scope%20in%20the%20receipt.%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
